    "narrative": "John Michael Smith \u2014 a composite read across 2 layers (astrology, human_design).\n\nCelestially, John Michael Smith carries a Gemini Sun (mutable air): quick, connective curiosity that thrives on exchange of ideas. The Taurus Moon colors the inner life with steady, sensory-grounded persistence that builds durable things, while a Leo Ascendant means others first meet expressive, warm-centered confidence that seeks creative visibility. The chart is weighted toward Water: identity runs on feeling-tone and resonance. Born under a Waning Crescent moon, there is a native orientation toward release, distillation, and completion.\n\nIn the Human Design system, John Michael Smith operates as a Generator \u2014 a sustainable life-force builder. The working strategy is \"To Respond\" with Emotional authority: decisions land best when they respond to what shows up rather than initiating from the mind. The 4/1 profile shapes how learning and purpose interlock. Defined channels (Mutation, Logic) mark where this energy is consistent and reliable.",
